<title>PHILIPPINES: Basic sees 1997 net up at 108.56 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Basic sees 1997 net up at 108.56 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Basic Petroleum and Minerals Inc said on Wednesday it expected its net income to rise to 108.56 million pesos this year.</p>
<p>The Philippine oil explorer reported net income of 7.56 million pesos in 1996.</p>
</text>
